In the flat shape the shipped line and the mutant line are identical -- every number the fixture
asserts is the same with the fix and without it, which is why the fixture was green before the
fixture was right. In the directory shape the mutant re-books the dropped file: 27 unwraps instead
of 26, 14 of them production, one file fewer in the uncompiled ledger.

Said in the fixture's own terms: the first version of the fixture, run against the shipped census
and against M13, passes both times and prints the same bytes.

